    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the World of <strong>Monsters' Gambits</strong>!</h2>Ever imagined a game that feels like the intense strategy of chess, the unpredictability of rolling dice, and the thrill of drawing that perfect card!!!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/42bdb52e35bd7080e304cb28dcf2b36a.poster.avif?t=1732346613\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/42bdb52e35bd7080e304cb28dcf2b36a.webm?t=1732346613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/42bdb52e35bd7080e304cb28dcf2b36a.mp4?t=1732346613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Mix and match to bring forth powerful level-two titans and the rare, formidable level-three behemoths.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/6730707707ad1fd8ae7fe5794a70acb1.poster.avif?t=1732346613\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/6730707707ad1fd8ae7fe5794a70acb1.webm?t=1732346613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/6730707707ad1fd8ae7fe5794a70acb1.mp4?t=1732346613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Choose from six different sigils - from Monsters to Attacks, Moves, Special Abilities and Traps.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/bed05fb2bdefd7ba7f7b24c30fff5791.poster.avif?t=1732346613\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/bed05fb2bdefd7ba7f7b24c30fff5791.webm?t=1732346613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/bed05fb2bdefd7ba7f7b24c30fff5791.mp4?t=1732346613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Play online with your friends or Enjoy your progress in Solo mode unlocking new decks and trying new monsters with outstanding special abilities and story.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/29695be61285465863b86c488839bf25.poster.avif?t=1732346613\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/29695be61285465863b86c488839bf25.webm?t=1732346613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/29695be61285465863b86c488839bf25.mp4?t=1732346613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>So, are you in for a game of Monsters' Gambits? It's not just another board game; it's the game that's changing the way we battle!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the World of <strong>Monsters' Gambits</strong>!</h2>Ever imagined a game that feels like the intense strategy of chess, the unpredictability of rolling dice, and the thrill of drawing that perfect card!!!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/42bdb52e35bd7080e304cb28dcf2b36a.poster.avif?t=1732346613\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/42bdb52e35bd7080e304cb28dcf2b36a.webm?t=1732346613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/42bdb52e35bd7080e304cb28dcf2b36a.mp4?t=1732346613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Mix and match to bring forth powerful level-two titans and the rare, formidable level-three behemoths.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/6730707707ad1fd8ae7fe5794a70acb1.poster.avif?t=1732346613\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/6730707707ad1fd8ae7fe5794a70acb1.webm?t=1732346613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/6730707707ad1fd8ae7fe5794a70acb1.mp4?t=1732346613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Choose from six different sigils - from Monsters to Attacks, Moves, Special Abilities and Traps.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/bed05fb2bdefd7ba7f7b24c30fff5791.poster.avif?t=1732346613\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/bed05fb2bdefd7ba7f7b24c30fff5791.webm?t=1732346613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/bed05fb2bdefd7ba7f7b24c30fff5791.mp4?t=1732346613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Play online with your friends or Enjoy your progress in Solo mode unlocking new decks and trying new monsters with outstanding special abilities and story.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/29695be61285465863b86c488839bf25.poster.avif?t=1732346613\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/29695be61285465863b86c488839bf25.webm?t=1732346613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365060/extras/29695be61285465863b86c488839bf25.mp4?t=1732346613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>So, are you in for a game of Monsters' Gambits? It's not just another board game; it's the game that's changing the way we battle!",
